        <vann:usageNote xml:lang="en">PDG type value used with prov:type in PROV-N/PROV-JSON/PROV-XML (prov:type=&apos;pdg:dataGenerationOther&apos;). Declared as a class equivalent to pdg:DataGenerationOther so that the rdf:type triple produced from prov:type by the PROV-O mapping is classified as pdg:DataGenerationOther.</vann:usageNote>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">a provenance structure that represents an agent for data generation different from software and device.</rdfs:comment>
